+## Auth
+
+Requests carry `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Roles: `viewer` (read `GET`
+except `/audit`), `cook` (also cook recipes, record waste, log temperatures,
+enter stock-take counts) and `manager` (everything, including `GET /audit`).
